632
00:24:22,093 --> 00:24:23,093
¿Cómo?

633
00:24:23,093 --> 00:24:24,093
Que nos tocamos algo.

634
00:24:24,093 --> 00:24:25,093
Sí, sí.

635
00:24:27,093 --> 00:24:28,093
A ver.

636
00:24:30,783 --> 00:24:31,783
