650
00:24:54,213 --> 00:24:55,213
Vale, chicos.

651
00:24:55,213 --> 00:24:56,503
Vamos.

652
00:24:56,503 --> 00:24:57,503
Vale.

653
00:24:57,503 --> 00:24:58,503
Vamos.

654
00:24:58,503 --> 00:25:00,363
Vale, que es la última.

655
00:25:00,363 --> 00:25:07,023
Vale.

656
00:25:08,823 --> 00:25:09,823
Bueno,

657
00:25:09,823 --> 00:25:10,823
todo tuyo.

658
00:25:11,863 --> 00:25:13,863
Vamos con soniar despiertos.

659
00:25:13,863 --> 00:25:14,863
Vale.

660
00:25:14,863 --> 00:25:15,863
Vale.

661
00:25:15,863 --> 00:25:17,503
Obvio.

662
00:25:17,503 --> 00:25:18,503
Arriba, ¿eh?

663
00:25:18,503 --> 00:28:33,233
Tantas veces me senté

664
00:28:33,233 --> 00:28:34,423
